# NOTED, and it changes C-g's reasoning rather than its act: the installer derives the stop-file path
# from -RepoRoot, not from the runtime root, so the NEW task's --stop-file is
#   C:\Users\Opal Bloomberg\Desktop\wk-harvest-runner-pin-3d88eccbc3\.runtime\harvest-cycle\STOP
